# Batch 31 (2026-11-18): breakthroughs that rewired the world (Newton, Faraday, telegraph, John Snow, Pasteur, X-rays, Curie, Wright brothers, DNA, ARPANET, CRISPR);
# the nuclear and space age, near misses and modern pandemics (Enigma, Hiroshima/Nagasaki, Gagarin, Cuban missile crisis, Apollo 13, Petrov 1983, Challenger, HIV/AIDS, COVID-19, Antonine Plague, polio vaccine);
